Welcome!

This projet's goal is to connect live time Kinect data into blender, then wrap a skin on the skeleton. In addition,
there will be goals for lighting, shading, and various properties. 

I will also provide a tutorial for installation.

PROJECT REQUIREMENTS:
 - Xbox 360 Kinect
 - Xbox 360 Kinect computer adaptor (AC - USB adaptor)
 - Developer Toolkit Browser v1.8.0 (Kinect for Windows)
 - Blender (I'm using version 4.4)

NOTES BEFORE STARTING:
 - There is a difference between an Xbox 360 Kinect and Xbox One Kinect. I am using an Xbox 360 kinect. 
 - There are two main versions of the Kinect for Windows (v1.8.0 and v2.0.0). v1.8.0 is for Xbox 360 Kinect and v2.0.0 is for Xbox One Kinect
 - There are more tutorials online for Xbox One, but this project only works with Xbox 360
